142
00:09:58.309 --> 00:10:00.434
Lohu.

143
00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:03.425
Ja.

144
00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:31.709
Ikka.

145
00:10:31.809 --> 00:10:32.040
Täitsa alla.

146
00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:34.050
Kaugel ei lennanud siin.

147
00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:37.870
Kiirus oli
ka peaaegu ju maanteekiirus 70

148
00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:40.170
